# Arc parity sweep (docs/arc-parity.md, Arc 1.172.1): Window ▸ Stay On Top floats the window and
# turns off again; Collapse All Folders / Expand All Folders close and open every folder in the
# space; View ▸ Collapse Pinned Tabs collapses the section and Tabs ▸ Reveal Tab in Sidebar (⌃Space)
# opens it again for the pinned tab that is open.
budget rss=700 stalls50=10
from://open?url=${PAGE}?n=one
expect-log loaded 127\.0\.0\.1 \(HTTP 200\)
from://action/stayOnTop
from://debug?browserWindows=top
expect-log Cra browser windows top: kind=normal .* onTop=1
from://action/stayOnTop
from://debug?browserWindows=down
expect-log Cra browser windows down: kind=normal .* onTop=0
from://action/pinTab
from://action/newFolder
from://action/newFolder
wait 1
from://action/collapseAllFolders
from://debug?browserWindows=closed
expect-log Cra browser windows closed: .* openFolders=0/2
from://action/expandAllFolders
from://debug?browserWindows=opened
expect-log Cra browser windows opened: .* openFolders=2/2
from://action/collapsePinned
from://debug?browserWindows=collapsed
expect-log Cra browser windows collapsed: .* pinnedCollapsed=1
from://action/revealTab
from://debug?browserWindows=revealed
expect-log Cra browser windows revealed: .* pinnedCollapsed=0
from://action/resetSpaceTabs
from://action/showArchive
from://action/openExtensions
wait 1
